<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <title>폴리오 - 관리</title>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/manage.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/calendar.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/sidebar.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/management.css">
    </head>
    <body class="managementApp" data-view="detail">
        <div class="appShell">{{> layout/sidebar}}
            <main class="mainArea">
                <div class="topBar"></div>
                <section class="notebook">{{> layout/bookLayout}}
                    <section class="leftPage">
                        <header class="managementIntro">
                            <div class="managementHeading">
                                <h1>관리 :</h1>
                                {{> layout/fluidToggle}}
                            </div>
                            <p>주기적으로 돌아오는 일정을 모아서 관리합니다.</p>
                            <p class="tip" id="weeklyBrief">이번 주 일정을 확인하고 있어요.</p>
                        </header>
                        <article class="largeMemo">
                            <img id="detailMemo" class="memoImage" src="/img/memo-health.png" alt="">
                            <img id="detailTape" class="categoryTape" src="/img/tape-blue.png" alt="">
                            <span id="detailCategory" class="categoryName">건강</span>
                            <a class="detailIcon" href="/index" aria-label="관리 화면으로 돌아가기"></a>
                            <form id="detailAddForm" class="detailAddForm">
                                <div class="detailAddFields">
                                    <label class="addName">관리 이름 :<input id="detailAddTitle" aria-label="새 관리 이름" required maxlength="100" autocomplete="off"></label>
                                    <label class="addDate">시작일 :<input id="detailAddStart" aria-label="새 관리 시작일" type="date" required min="2000-01-01" max="2100-12-31"></label>
                                    <label class="addCycle">주기 :<span><input id="detailAddInterval" aria-label="새 관리 주기" type="number" min="1" max="365" required><select id="detailAddUnit" aria-label="새 관리 주기 단위"><option value="MONTH">개월</option><option value="DAY">일</option><option value="WEEK">주</option><option value="YEAR">년</option></select></span></label>
                                </div>
                                <button id="detailAddSave" type="submit" aria-label="관리 일정 등록"></button>
                            </form>
                            <p id="detailAddError" class="detailAddError" role="alert"></p>
                            <div id="detailList" class="detailList" aria-label="관리 일정 목록"></div>
                        </article>
                    </section>
                    {{> layout/managementAnalysis}}

                </section>
            </main>
        </div>
        <p id="appStatus" class="appStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        {{> layout/quickManagement}}
        <script src="/js/management.js" defer></script>
    </body>

</html>
